	Dear Raph and creative coding community,

	used an older sketch and added the method to insert
	the gol glider machine. it mass produces gliders thru an
	loop of states. 
	Both the machine and the gliders reproducing their states,
	one giving gliders birth, the other moving forward an dying at the edge.

	Join the Birb's Nest Discord for friendly creative coding community
